"<strong>We recommend using OAuth</strong> for new integrations.\n"
"                            Shopify has deprecated legacy custom apps and "
"replaced them with a new approach\n"
"                            using their Dev Dashboard. We maintain support "
"for legacy applications\n"
"                            to ensure existing customers can continue using "
"their current setup without reconnecting.\n"
"                            However, for new integrations or when possible, "
"we strongly recommend using\n"
"                            the OAuth option."
